nal state), and no screenshot shows the OS filter being removed.\n\n## Conclusion\nThe agent searched for gaming desktops, applied both required filters (Windows 11 Home OS and 1TB hard drive size), and successfully identified a specific matching product (STGAubron Gaming PC Desktop with 1TB SSD) that appears in the filtered results. The core task objective is met despite the minor count discrepancy in the response text.\n\n**Verdict: SUCCESS**",
